    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      375.29,
      401.9,
      534.23
    ],
    "text": "(1)in subsection (1) of that section, by the substitutionfor the words and figures, \u201cunder subsection (3) ofsection 65(3) and such number of members soelected do not include any women members, thenthe provisions of subsections (3) and (4) of thissection shall not apply to such recognized politicalparty or independent group.\u201d of the words andfigures, \u201cunder subsection (3) of section 65B andsuch number of members so elected do not includeany women members, then the provisions ofsubsections (3) and (4) of this section shall notapply to such recognized political party orindependent group.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
