  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      547.49,
      401.9,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "(2)in subsection (2) of that section, by the substitutionfor the words and figures, \u201cand has less than threemembers elected or returned, then the provisions ofsubsections (3) and (4) of this section shall notapply to such recognized political party orindependent group.\u201d of the words and figures,\u201cand has less than three members elected or returned,then the provisions of subsections (3) and (4) ofthis section shall not apply to such recognizedpolitical party or independent group.\u201d;",
